WEBVTT

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:32.824
just a handful of companies
have already pledged more removals

00:23:32.866 --> 00:23:35.201
than the entire world could provide.

00:23:37.036 --> 00:23:38.371
At a global level,

00:23:38.371 --> 00:23:40.623
removing carbon dioxide
from the atmosphere

00:23:40.623 --> 00:23:43.835
will be essential
for limiting global warming.

00:23:43.877 --> 00:23:47.297
As the IPCC, for example,
has made abundantly clear.

00:23:48.631 --> 00:23:52.886
But having corporate actors
purchase removals in bulk

00:23:52.927 --> 00:23:55.889
to achieve their own
mini versions of net zero

00:23:55.889 --> 00:23:58.099
misses the forest for the trees.

00:23:59.642 --> 00:24:03.521
The world desperately needs
to reduce emissions.